        {
          "block_label": "figure_title",
          "block_content": "Figure 3.7.1: Wild rabbits in Australia. The rabbit population grew so quickly in Australia that the event became known as the “rabbit plague.” (credit: Richard Taylor, Flickr)",
          "block_bbox": [
            314,
