        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Uncontrolled population growth, as in the wild rabbits in Australia, can be modeled with exponential functions. Equations resulting from those exponential functions can be solved to analyze and make predictions about exponential growth. In this section, we will learn techniques for solving exponential functions.",
          "block_bbox": [
            207,
            1614,
            2336,
            1773
          ],
          "block_id": 11,
          "block_order": 9,
          "group_id": 11,
          "block_polygon_points": [
            [
